<title>USA: Adaptec to take $0.08-$0.12/shr Q4 charge.</title>
<headline>Adaptec to take $0.08-$0.12/shr Q4 charge.</headline>
<dateline>MILPITAS, Calif. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Adaptec Inc said late Tuesday it will book a charge of $0.08 to $0.12 a share in the fourth fiscal quarter, which ended March 31, for in-process research and development acquired.</p>
<p>The company said that it has completed its preliminary evaluation of the allocation of the purchase price to the assets acquired in association with its recently announced acquisitions of CD-Recordable software technology (Toast) and Skipstone Inc.</p>
</text>
